gaPu(){return"Authentic Amiga pitch slides"},
gaPv(){return"Play imported MOD and S3M modules the way the hardware did \u2014 a slide speeds up as it rises. Off is gentler and evenly spaced. Only affects those two formats; XM, IT and songs you make here are unchanged"},
